### Health Check
GET http://localhost:1323/

### 1. Buat Order Baru
POST http://localhost:1323/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Budi Santoso",
  "customer_email": "budi@example.com",
  "items": [
    {
      "product_id": "PROD-001",
      "quantity": 2
    },
    {
      "product_id": "PROD-002",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 2. Ambil Semua Daftar Order
GET http://localhost:1323/api/v1/orders

### 3. Ambil Detail Order (Ganti ORDER_ID sesuai response create)
GET http://localhost:1323/api/v1/orders/ORD-CONTOH

### 4. Batalkan Order
PUT http://localhost:1323/api/v1/orders/ORD-CONTOH/cancel

### 5. Simulasi Pembayaran Sukses
POST http://localhost:1323/api/v1/orders/ORD-CONTOH/pay

### 6. Simulasi Callback Webhook dari Payment Gateway
POST http://localhost:1323/api/v1/payments/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "order_id": "ORD-CONTOH",
  "payment_id": "PAY-123456",
  "transaction_status": "settlement",
  "payment_method": "qris",
  "gross_amount": 195000
}

